    "70dfaae2-78e5-44d9-a3d6-5a1b053831e4": {
      "@type": "slate",
      "plaintext": "To make sure your day goes smoothly, you should bring your laptop and a charger because a few of the workshops are hands-on and power outlets in the rooms are limited, and you'll also need a photo ID that matches the name on your registration so we can print your badge at check-in, and we'd recommend a reusable water bottle since there are refill stations on every floor but we're not handing out plastic bottles this year, plus some business cards if you still use them because the closing drinks are a great time to swap contacts, and finally comfy shoes and a light jacket, because the venue is big and Hall A gets pretty chilly with the AC on.",
      "styles": {},
      "theme": "default",
      "value": [
        {
          "children": [
